WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.226
Obirée ka masaya tun ye min ye. O ye tarikiko dɔ lo ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.144
Obiré dugu la, Burkina Faso worodugu ni tileben fan fɛ.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.554
O kɔ, masacɛkɔrɔba ye mɔgɔw ladon a ka luu kɔnɔ. An b'an kunbiri gwan a kɔrɔ.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.744
Masacɛ, an b'i fo.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.712
Aw ye na ne ka soo.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.194
Nka, masacɛ tun be kasira. A sɛgɛnnin lo ani mɔgɔ bɛɛ b'a ye.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.608
Loon dɔ sufɛ, kibaroya bɔra ko masacɛ sara.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.912
Burufiyɛkanw bɛ o kibaroya lase mɔgɔw ma, jamana bɛɛ bɛ kasira.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.392
O tagara ni o ye yiritu sira fɛ, ka taga masacɛw ta kaburuw yɔrɔ ra.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.800
Aw bɛmaw, aw dɔ nana ni aw ye.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:01.344
O yɔrɔ la, masacɛ minw tun halakira, olu bele b'u ka mɔgɔw kɔrɔsi.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:21.826
Masacɛ ka masasigilan tɛ to k'a yɔrɔlakolon ye. Diinan mɔgɔkɔrɔw ka jɛnkulu be ɲɔgɔn lajɛn.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:31.236
O kɔ, u y'u ka misiw fili. Masacɛw b'u kɔnɔna. Jɔn lo bena kɛ masacɛ kura ye?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.712
Masacɛ dɔ woloma.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.026
An be taga n'a ye yɔrɔjan. Masacɛ nata labɛnna dogo la, mɔgɔ si tɛ se k'a ye.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:13.280
O kɔ, u y'a fɔ ko o sufɛ, an bɛmacɛw nana a kunbɛn.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:36.354
A ka masaya loon be surunyana. Masacɛ ka dùgu be yɛlɛ masacɛ kura kun na.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:49.872
Bamananw ni dɔnkiliw b'a yira jamana mɔgɔw la ko sirada tɛ tiɲɛna.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.976
Hali bi, ganw ka masaya be to Obiré.
